[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 15781.67, "timestamp": "04:23:01", "text": "あなたは何者ですか？ちくしょう。あなたは何者ですか？"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15784.308, "timestamp": "04:23:04", "author": "@site36.official", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Oc0kgq4lSUaD-BoDbaDE3pXUquuz47c4Yh7kwPILHO2D70EQ5EnEgoGgTbb5gw993EEXRqCx_A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "I finally did an EDM track for you 🙂 😀 "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15785.51, "timestamp": "04:23:05", "text": "そう、だって、そう感じたから。私"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15787.51, "timestamp": "04:23:07", "text": "適切な聴衆がいない、または"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15789.75, "timestamp": "04:23:09", "text": "何か、私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15792.229, "timestamp": "04:23:12", "text": "聴衆を適切に迎え入れる。私はある意味放棄した"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15794.07, "timestamp": "04:23:14", "text": "今は、"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15796.79, "timestamp": "04:23:16", "text": "コミュニティのあれこれ、招待可能なコミュニティ"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 15797.985, "timestamp": "04:23:17", "author": "@site36.official", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/Oc0kgq4lSUaD-BoDbaDE3pXUquuz47c4Yh7kwPILHO2D70EQ5EnEgoGgTbb5gw993EEXRqCx_A=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "Took me ages to figure out the beat patterns "}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15801.51, "timestamp": "04:23:21", "text": "そして全てがうまくいって、それが私を"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15804.469, "timestamp": "04:23:24", "text": "悲しいけど、ジェイダのおかげで私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15807.189, "timestamp": "04:23:27", "text": "何時間もみんなと話をする。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15810.389, "timestamp": "04:23:30", "text": "私は嬉しい。でも、私が"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15812.71, "timestamp": "04:23:32", "text": "優先してコラボレーションはしなかった"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15815.55, "timestamp": "04:23:35", "text": "コラボレーションしたくなるような感じ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15818.95, "timestamp": "04:23:38", "text": "他のコミュニティと同じようにストリームします"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15821.189, "timestamp": "04:23:41", "text": "他の人のコミュニティがやって来て"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15823.83, "timestamp": "04:23:43", "text": "彼らはあなたを見て車を止めますが、私は感じました"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15826.55, "timestamp": "04:23:46", "text": "そういう瞬間があるはずだ"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15828.389, "timestamp": "04:23:48", "text": "ソロ配信をしたら、みんなが私のところにやってくる"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15831.87, "timestamp": "04:23:51", "text": "そういう感じですよね、そして私は"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15836.07, "timestamp": "04:23:56", "text": "それはあまり起こらなかったし、すべてが"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 15838.229, "timestamp": "04:23:58", "text": "それで"}]